        Your financial life is <span class="underline decoration-emerald-500 decoration-4 underline-offset-8">not</span> a lead generation funnel.
      </h1>

      <!-- Value Hook Subtitle -->
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        The private, self-hosted personal finance OS designed for India. Zero telemetry, client-side statement parsing, anchor-aware ledger math, and native tracking for EPF, PPF, NPS, SGBs, and mutual funds.
      </p>

      <!-- Primary Waitlist Email Capture -->
      <div id="waitlist" class="pt-4 flex flex-col items-center">
